1. Cap nhat user controller helper.
2. Them unit tests vao `user.controller.test.ts`.
3. Chay tests/lint/build.
4. Manual verify Redis neu can.

## Khong lam trong feature nay

- Khong them socket event moi.
- Khong sua frontend socket hook.
