## Quyet dinh mac dinh

- Invalidate dua tren request body co field `timezone`/`preferredCurrency`, khong so sanh old/new value.
- Cache invalidation la best-effort.
- Goi invalidation trong controller de gan voi profile update workflow va changed fields.

